s=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got 45 unique mercenaries to choose from\u2014covering everything from front-line defenders to high-damage attackers and support roles. Adjust your lineup to make the most of their abilities and address any gaps in your strategy. Stand strong against every wave of challenges and immerse yourself in the excitement of tactical gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338570/extras/4b571092e405308849dbe987f8ab628d.poster.avif?t=1737625988\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338570/extras/4b571092e405308849dbe987f8ab628d.webm?t=1737625988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338570/extras/4b571092e405308849dbe987f8ab628d.mp4?t=1737625988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Legion Defense is a TD game made with the \u300eCliCli\u300f.that swaps boring mercenaries for epic hero showdowns! In special rounds, you\u2019ll face enemy heroes and feel the thrill of battle. The KOF mode allows for 3v3 matches to compete for the top spot. join the ultimate battle now!",
